  unitName: Elphelt
  unitId: 51207
  unitNumber: 1642
  description: A young woman clad in a dress, given to a violent style of fighting
    with her guns. She was created as one of the 'Valentines,' living weapons which
    were created for the purpose of eradicating humanity. However, she decided to
    side with humanity having gained self-awareness. She loves nature and animals,
    having also a caring heart which cannot ignore lonely individuals. She is also
    very optimistic, believing that any problem can be overcome as long as one takes
    action. However, these feelings also give rise to an extraordinary passion within
    her to wed.
  summonDesc: This is my Virgin Road!<br>I'm not much good at anything, but please
    be kind to me!
  fusionDesc: May my love strike true!<br>I've still got another love dart!
